7:/// - PRE-FLIGHT stays hard-only (`shouldCompact` — over the line → fold
8:///   before the request); the hard guard is never suppressed.
9:/// - POST-RUN fires the soft line: the bucket the main request just
10:///   warmed is still hot, so the merged call reads it from cache.
