30:/// The soft trigger line in tokens: `floor(softRatio × window)` when the
31:/// key is set, else the hard line minus [softRatioDefaultGap] of the
32:/// window (never below 1).
33:int softTriggerTokens({
34:  required int window,
35:  required CompactionSettings settings,
36:  double? softRatio,
37:}) {
38:  if (softRatio != null) return max(1, (window * softRatio).floor());
39:  final hard = window - settings.reserveTokens;
40:  return max(1, hard - (window * softRatioDefaultGap).floor());
