71:  /// User turns that must pass after a run before the soft line may
72:  /// fire again (`compaction.handOver.hysteresisTurns`). Writable so a
73:  /// host that re-resolves its settings per run (the Flutter app) can
74:  /// keep ONE counter across config flips.
