968:  /// [shouldCompact]) and [_runManualCompact] (unconditional), plus the
969:  /// resume boot cap (which passes the session explicitly — at boot
970:  /// `_session` is not assigned yet). Returns whether a pass reported
971:  /// success (a rendered report block).
