381:/// (the `smol`/`main` role — review major 3: a report that doesn't name
382:/// the engine can't be judged), how many records were hidden vs
383:/// summarized, and — when the pass actually wrote summary text — the
384:/// summary in a fenced block so the user can eyeball — and copy — what
385:/// the transcript was condensed to. A pass with no summary text (all
386:/// evictions went to hide, or the model returned blank — issue #578)
387:/// omits the block: an empty ```-fence says nothing and reads as a bug.
