390:/// gh-1636: the internal checkpoint text is debug output, not
391:/// conversation. By default ([details] false) the report is ONE short
392:/// marker line — `auto-compacted · ENGINE: N → M tokens (F freed ·
393:/// P%)`; the `records:` line and the fenced summary only render with
394:/// `details: true` (the `tui.showCompactionDetails` opt-in, or the
395:/// manual `/compact` — the on-demand expansion). The summary itself is
396:/// never lost: it stays in the session file, reachable via
